  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2023-03-25T11:15:50.209Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "2 images appear to be permanently buffering in one of my group gallery. On the website, I cannot delete these but the thumbnail is greyed out and animated (I assume this is the loading animation for images):\n\n(attached screenshot 1)\n\nIN game, the 2 broken images appear as an hourglass (attached screenshot 2)\n\nLink to the group gallery (broken images are in the 3rd category):\n\nhttps://vrchat.com/home/group/grp_bf9ef3f5-89f5-424c-b70c-30ca289746ac/galleries\n\nedit: to add, the images they should be are deleted from my gallery. I normally delete from group gallery first before deleting them from personal gallery so perhaps I did this too quick?",
